    {
      "text": "Brah, you're sitting at $738.41 total spend for the period and you're *over* on basically everything that matters.\n\nParking is $23.72 against a $10 cap\u2014you're $13.72 over. Dining out is $84.89 against a $75 cap\u2014$9.89 over. Slop is $69.42 against a $50 cap\u2014$19.42 over. That's three categories you're supposed to be controlling and you're bleeding on all three. Your checking is at $184.21 when it should be at $1,500. That Delta card is still at $3,773.84 eating interest.\n\nHere's the real problem: you've proven you can nail groceries and kill partying, but you keep leaking cash on parking fines, convenience store runs, and dining out. Stop making excuses about the small stuff\u2014those are the leaks that are keeping you broke. Cut the parking runs, zero the 7-Eleven trips, and lock dining out down to $50 max for the rest of the period.\n\nYou're close to executing. What's actually changing *today*?",
